Stop the per-run signal handler when Launcher.Run returns (cosmovisor v1.7.3).
Exit 0 when a stop arrives after the app has already exited.

Upstream PR: https://github.com/cosmos/cosmos-sdk/pull/26879 (commits aeb05101 and 4513d133).
Drop this patch and build the upstream release once a cosmovisor release contains it.

Apply at the root of cosmossdk.io/tools/cosmovisor@v1.7.3.

